# Terminal GIF for the README:  vhs docs/tapes/status.tape
Output docs/img/cli-status.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1560
Set Height 310
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "cd ~/code/darwin && export PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Show
Sleep 600ms
Type "uv run darwin status"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "uv run darwin spend"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
